				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.147
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>:—<i>want, have need of</i>, c. gen., ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.3
			</span></i>
